# ref-a2e4816-zero-dt
# A time step of zero runs the broad-phase and collision but skips the solver
# (box3d a2e4816 documents this on b3World_Step). A box overlapping a ground box
# at dt=0 still reports the contact and sensor events without integrating, so
# the body transform is unchanged across the step.
# Reference: vanilla float box3d at upstream commit a2e4816.
# Observable: the body transform is unchanged (zero dt) while the contact is
#   still reported.
expect pos 0.0001 rot 0.0001 vel 0.0001 horizon 1 counts exact
world gravity 0 -10 0 dt 0 1 substeps 4 steps 1
body static position 0 -0.5 0 rotation 0 0 0 1 linvel 0 0 0 angvel 0 0 0
shape 0 box 10 0.5 10 density 1 friction 0.5 restitution 0
body dynamic position 0 0.4 0 rotation 0 0 0 1 linvel 0 0 0 angvel 0 0 0
shape 1 box 0.5 0.5 0.5 density 1 friction 0.5 restitution 0
